-- ===========================================================================
-- INDEPENDENT TESTS for row IL-27 (test author fid-il-27, 2026-10-09).
-- Every expected value is the one in DECIDED-ANSWERS.md (sha256 6957cca3...ecfcda), worked by hand from the Hebrew before this
-- encoding was opened. Case ids (A01, D05, ...) are those of DECIDED-ANSWERS.md. No expected value was changed to match the code.
-- Points are exact fractions; a NIS amount is points x 2,904 (2026).
-- Lines marked "EXPECTED DISAGREEMENT" are declared in check.sh: the encoding is expected to disagree, with the class in
-- INDEPENDENT-FINDINGS.md.
