§ `Independent tests — row IL-27`

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- builders
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      served IS A NUMBER
      em IS A NUMBER
      ey IS A NUMBER
      sx IS A `A person's sex, for these sections`
GIVETH A `A discharged soldier in a tax year, for section 39A`
`ind39A in` y `, served` served `months, ended in month` em `of` ey `, sex` sx MEANS
    `A discharged soldier in a tax year, for section 39A` OF y, TRUE, sx, TRUE, served, ey, em, FALSE

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      days IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A combat reservist in a tax year, for section 39B`
`ind39B in` y `, days` days MEANS
    `A combat reservist in a tax year, for section 39B` OF y, TRUE, days, FALSE

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      sx IS A `A person's sex, for these sections`
      dv IS A BOOLEAN
      pd IS A BOOLEAN
      rm IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A divorced individual in a tax year, for section 40A`
`ind40A in` y `, sex` sx `, divorcee` dv `, maintenance` pd `, remarried` rm MEANS
    `A divorced individual in a tax year, for section 40A` OF y, TRUE, sx, dv, pd, rm, FALSE

GIVEN born IS A DATE
      sp IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH AN `An individual and a spouse, for section 40B`
`ind40B born` born `spouse` sp MEANS
    `An individual and a spouse, for section 40B` OF 2026, TRUE, born, sp, FALSE

