§§ `B. Section 35(c), (e) and the rules of 5738-1977 (B01-B16)`

-- B01: absent 1 Jan to 30 Jun 2025, excluded on request; read through the period mechanism with rule 3 reaching the 54 months.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 35 with rule 3 of the rules of 5738-1977, reading "the 42 months" as` `rule 3 reaches the 54 months as well` `, for` (`ind35 in` 2026 `, from` (YMD 2024 1 1) `, months` `ind every month` `, left out` (LIST (`A period left out of the count of months under rule 3` OF (YMD 2025 1 1), 6))) EQUALS 3
-- B02: five months absent, no exclusion: A09 = 5/2.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 35 with rule 3 for` (`ind35 in` 2026 `, from` (YMD 2024 1 1) `, months` `ind every month` `, left out` (LIST )) EQUALS 5/2
-- B06: resident nine months of the aliyah year, 9 x 1/12 = 3/4.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 35 with rule 3 for` (`ind35 in` 2026 `, from` (YMD 2026 1 1) `, months` (LIST 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9) `, left out` (LIST )) EQUALS 3/4
-- B08: aliyah 1 Jul 2026, regular service Aug 2026 for 24 months left out on request: only July counts, 1/12 (reading named).
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 35 with rule 3 of the rules of 5738-1977, reading "the 42 months" as` `rule 3 reaches the 54 months as well` `, for` (`ind35 in` 2026 `, from` (YMD 2026 7 1) `, months` `ind from July` `, left out` (LIST (`A period left out of the count of months under rule 3` OF (YMD 2026 8 1), 24))) EQUALS 1/12
-- B10-B13: rule 2(1).
#ASSERT `treated as an immigrant under rule 2 of the rules of 5738-1977:` (`ind rule2 born` (YMD 1950 1 1) `became` (JUST (YMD 1976 5 1)) `stayed` 18 `received` FALSE `left` NOTHING `returned` NOTHING) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `treated as an immigrant under rule 2 of the rules of 5738-1977:` (`ind rule2 born` (YMD 1950 1 1) `became` (JUST (YMD 1976 5 1)) `stayed` 24 `received` FALSE `left` NOTHING `returned` NOTHING) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `treated as an immigrant under rule 2 of the rules of 5738-1977:` (`ind rule2 born` (YMD 1950 1 1) `became` (JUST (YMD 1976 5 1)) `stayed` 25 `received` FALSE `left` NOTHING `returned` NOTHING) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `treated as an immigrant under rule 2 of the rules of 5738-1977:` (`ind rule2 born` (YMD 1950 1 1) `became` (JUST (YMD 1976 5 1)) `stayed` 12 `received` TRUE `left` NOTHING `returned` NOTHING) EQUALS FALSE
-- B14-B15: rule 2(2): an immigrant who left at 17 (born 1960) on 1 Jan 1977 and returned after exactly five years / four years eleven months.
#ASSERT `treated as an immigrant under rule 2 of the rules of 5738-1977:` (`ind rule2 born` (YMD 1960 1 1) `became` (JUST (YMD 1970 1 1)) `stayed` 36 `received` FALSE `left` (JUST (YMD 1977 1 1)) `returned` (JUST (YMD 1982 1 1))) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `treated as an immigrant under rule 2 of the rules of 5738-1977:` (`ind rule2 born` (YMD 1960 1 1) `became` (JUST (YMD 1970 1 1)) `stayed` 36 `received` FALSE `left` (JUST (YMD 1977 1 1)) `returned` (JUST (YMD 1981 12 1))) EQUALS FALSE
-- B16: rule 2(3): left as a minor (17), returned after six years: yes; left aged 18: no.
#ASSERT `treated as an immigrant under rule 2 of the rules of 5738-1977:` (`ind rule2 born` (YMD 1960 1 1) `became` NOTHING `stayed` 0 `received` FALSE `left` (JUST (YMD 1977 1 1)) `returned` (JUST (YMD 1983 1 1))) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `treated as an immigrant under rule 2 of the rules of 5738-1977:` (`ind rule2 born` (YMD 1958 1 1) `became` NOTHING `stayed` 0 `received` FALSE `left` (JUST (YMD 1977 1 1)) `returned` (JUST (YMD 1983 1 1))) EQUALS FALSE

